{"When checking if a slot falls within working hours, both the computed start and end minutes are based on the slot start time, so the slot's actual end time is never validated and slots that extend past the end of working hours can still be considered valid": 0.9696314930915833, "Override time conversion subtracts the organizer's UTC offset twice by applying inviteeUtcOffset - organizerUtcOffset to a UTC-normalized time, yielding incorrect local time for overrides in non-UTC timezones (e.g., a 10:00 override in UTC+1 will appear as 08:00 for an invitee in UTC instead of 09:00)": 0.6946713328361511}